{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122015","id":4185290854,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc75dnhm","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122015","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122015.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122015.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122015","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122015/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122015/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122015/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/50a696ccc6363eec6962d34e122b57723226ff96","number":122015,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Shader baker: use the target driver for the RENDER_DRIVER_ define","user":{"login":"hortopan","id":917773,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNzc3Mw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/917773?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hortopan","html_url":"https://github.com/hortopan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hortopan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hortopan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hortopan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hortopan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hortopan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hortopan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hortopan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hortopan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hortopan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #122014\r\n\r\nThe shader baker generated baked shader sources with the `RENDER_DRIVER_*` define of the\r\ndriver the editor is running on, instead of the driver the shaders are baked for\r\n(e.g. `RENDER_DRIVER_METAL` when exporting for Windows from a macOS editor). The shader\r\ncache SHA1 doesn't cover this define, so a wrong bake is indistinguishable from a\r\ncorrect one.\r\n\r\nThis PR threads an optional driver name through `version_build_variant_stage_sources()`\r\n→ `_build_variant_stage_sources()` → `_build_variant_code()` so the baker can pass the\r\ntarget container driver. The parameter defaults to the current behavior (host driver),\r\nso runtime compilation and the native source-code inspector are unchanged.\r\n\r\nTested: full editor build on macOS (arm64).","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":410064485,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0MTAwNjQ0ODU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/needs%20testing","name":"needs testing","description":"","color":"ffcc44","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2909900850,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyOTA5OTAwODUw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:export","name":"topic:export","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title